 {"(this controller has none)","(este mando no tiene)"},
 {"A player with a different version of the game is trying to join. Both need the same release.","Un jugador con otra versión intenta entrar. Ambos necesitan la misma versión."},
 {"A third fighter, played by the computer, joins the next fight that starts.\nOnly in a one against one fight of Duel (against the computer) or of training;\nstory, tournaments, team battles, two-player split screen and replays stay as they are.\nIt has no health bar yet, and a replay saved from such a fight will not play back right.","Añade un luchador CPU al siguiente duelo individual o entrenamiento compatible. Experimental: no se aplica a historia, torneos, pantalla dividida ni repeticiones."},
 {"A trigger counts as pressed from %d%% on. The game is told pressed or not, nothing between.","El gatillo se activa a partir del %d%%. El juego solo distingue entre pulsado y sin pulsar."},
