 {"Each picture waits for the display's refresh. Turn it on if the picture tears.\nOff is the default: it adds a little delay.","Espera a la actualización de la pantalla para evitar cortes en la imagen. Puede añadir un poco de retraso. Desactivado por defecto."},
 {"Each player selects their own fighter","Cada jugador elige su luchador"},
 {"Exit","Salir"},
 {"Experimental. The game computes a fight 30 times a second. With this, more pictures are\ndrawn between each two. The fight itself does not change, and neither does online play.\nThe newest picture reaches the screen later: 17 ms at 60, 25 ms at 120, 29 ms at 240.\nChoose what your screen can show. F9 switches it off and on.","Experimental: añade imágenes intermedias sin cambiar las reglas del combate. Puede aumentar el retraso visual. Elige una tasa compatible con tu pantalla. F9 activa o desactiva esta opción."},
 {"Fight a player on another computer. One of you hosts, the other joins with the host's address.","Combate contra alguien en otro PC. Uno crea la partida y el otro entra con su dirección."},
 {"For a two-player Team Battle or Free-for-All of the modes page (SELECT on the main menu), with two members or more a team: controller 3 plays team 1's second member, controller 4 team 2's. The screen is split in four, one quarter a player.","Configura cuántos jugadores locales pueden participar. Asigna los mandos y equipos en la selección antes de empezar."},
 {"Glare and glow","Resplandor y brillo"},
 {"How far the stick has to be moved before the game is told anything (the shaded middle).\nOriginal: the game's own, 39%% for left / right and for up / down separately, a square.\n0%% to 90%%: a round one of that size instead; from its edge the value grows evenly\nto full at full tilt, and the stick counts as a direction half way between the two.\nThe white dot is the stick, the ring what the game is given; after the stick's name,\nthe direction the game takes it for. Choose a size that covers where the dot rests\nwhen the stick is let go.","Distancia que debes mover la palanca antes de que responda el juego. La zona sombreada es la zona muerta. Auméntala si el mando se mueve solo."},
 {"How fast the game runs outside online play (the sound keeps its pitch). 100%% is the game's own;\n114%% is what competitive play uses. An online match never uses this value:\nits speed is the host's or the queue's.","Velocidad de los combates locales. 100%% es la original y 114%% la competitiva. En línea se usa la velocidad del anfitrión o de la cola."},
 {"How fast the match runs, for both players; the sound keeps its pitch.\n100%% is the game's own speed. %d%% is the competitive standard, and what\nquick matches run at.\nWith a player on 0.1.29 only 100%% and 120%% are possible, with an older\nrelease only 100%%.","Velocidad del combate para ambos jugadores. El sonido conserva su tono. 100%% es la velocidad original; %d%% es la competitiva y la de las partidas rápidas."},
 {"How well the computer plays it, 0 to 29.\nThe game's own five levels are 0, 6, 13, 21 and 29.","Habilidad de la CPU, de 0 a 29. Los cinco niveles originales son 0, 6, 13, 21 y 29."},
 {"How wide the online chat is and how many lines it shows (while typing / otherwise).\nCompact: 4 / 2, narrower.\nNormal: 6 / 4.\nLarge: 8 / 6, wider, for large screens.","Tamaño del chat y líneas visibles al escribir / en reposo: compacto 4 / 2, normal 6 / 4 y grande 8 / 6."},
 {"In a picture wider than 4:3, show the menus at their own shape with black at the sides\ninstead of stretched to the width. Fights keep the wide picture.","Conserva la proporción original de los menús, con franjas laterales. Los combates siguen usando la pantalla panorámica."},
 {"Input delay","Retraso de entrada"},
 {"It also empties your records list, and it becomes permanent the next time the game saves. Use it after your save has been loaded (from the main menu on).","También borra los récords. El cambio se vuelve permanente al guardar. Úsalo después de cargar tu partida."},
 {"Left trigger","Gatillo izquierdo"},
 {"Local fights: tap Square in beam struggles, Triangle in rush struggles.\nUses the controller assigned to each fighter, including players 3 and 4.\nOutside struggles the original buttons keep their normal actions.\nOnline play keeps the game's own controls.","En combates locales, pulsa Cuadrado repetidamente en choques de rayos y Triángulo en choques cuerpo a cuerpo. En línea y en repeticiones se mantienen las reglas originales."},
