 {"SELECT opens the mod modes. Set up the teams in character selection before starting the match.","SELECT abre los modos del mod. La selección de cada modo permite preparar los equipos antes del combate."},
 {"Searching for %d:%02d more. Leave the window open.","Buscando durante %d:%02d más. Deja la ventana abierta."},
 {"See-through tint","Silueta tras obstáculos"},
 {"Takes effect the next time the game starts. Both draw the same picture; Vulkan is faster.\nIf the chosen one cannot start, the game tries the other.","Se aplica al reiniciar. Ambos muestran la misma imagen; Vulkan suele ser más rápido. Si uno no arranca, se prueba el otro."},
 {"Team","Equipo"},
 {"Text with the other player of an online match. Tab opens a line (setting key_chat), Enter sends it,\nEsc puts it away; while it is typed the keyboard does not play, a controller does. Off: no lines\nare shown or sent. A player without it sees nothing.","Chat con tu rival en línea. Tab abre el texto, Intro lo envía y Esc lo cierra. Al escribir, el teclado deja de controlar al luchador; el mando sigue funcionando."},
 {"Texture pack (%d textures)","Paquete de texturas (%d texturas)"},
 {"The CPU compares the opponent's power (the select-screen value) with its own and only transforms when the opponent is at least as strong and already ahead on health. A near-equal opponent makes it take one form; a much stronger one makes it jump toward its top form. The preset sets how far behind it must be: Standard a tenth of its bars, Aggressive half of that, Always any lost health. Stock costs and model admission still apply. Native keeps the original AI. Training has separate behavior below; online and replays are unchanged.","La CPU puede transformarse cuando está en desventaja de poder y salud. Estándar espera a perder un 10% de salud; Agresivo, un 5%; Siempre, cualquier cantidad. Se mantienen los requisitos de reservas y formas disponibles. Original conserva la IA del juego. El entrenamiento se configura aparte; no cambia el juego en línea ni las repeticiones."},
 {"The black line around the fighters.","La línea negra alrededor de los luchadores."},
 {"The bloom around bright things and the sky's glare.","El halo de los objetos brillantes y el resplandor del cielo."},
 {"The blur of the scenery while the view turns or moves fast.","El desenfoque al girar o mover la cámara rápidamente."},
 {"The game reads the controller, computes, and then waits before the picture is shown:\nabout 33 ms in a fight. With this on the wait comes first, so the picture follows\nyour press by the few milliseconds the machine needs. The game itself is unchanged.\nNot used online or with in-between pictures. Off by default: on a machine that\ncannot keep up it may stutter where the original order would not.","Reduce la espera entre pulsar un botón y ver la respuesta. Experimental: puede causar tirones en equipos lentos. No se usa en línea ni con interpolación."},
 {"The game's own vibration (hits, clashes, charging), on this player's controller.\nThe game's Options > Controller > Vibration has to be on as well: it is, unless you turned it off.\nThe game gives none in a replay or for a side the computer plays.","Vibración del mando de este jugador durante golpes, choques y cargas de energía."},
 {"The haze that colours distant things.","La neblina que tiñe los objetos lejanos."},
 {"The host's choices apply to both players.","Las opciones del anfitrión se aplican a ambos jugadores."},
 {"The host's game is a different version. Both players need the same release.","El anfitrión tiene otra versión. Ambos necesitan la misma versión."},
 {"The last fight was left as the game's own: a side had more than one member.","El combate anterior mantuvo las reglas originales: el modo no admite luchadores extra."},
 {"The last fight was left as the game's own: an online match never has one.","El combate anterior mantuvo las reglas originales: el modo no admite luchadores extra."},
 {"The last fight was left as the game's own: it had a script.","El combate anterior mantuvo las reglas originales: el modo no admite luchadores extra."},
 {"The last fight was left as the game's own: it was a replay.","El combate anterior mantuvo las reglas originales: el modo no admite luchadores extra."},
 {"The last fight was left as the game's own: only Duel and training fights get one.","El combate anterior mantuvo las reglas originales: el modo no admite luchadores extra."},
 {"The last fight was left as the game's own: the character's files were not found.","El combate anterior mantuvo las reglas originales: faltan los archivos del personaje."},
 {"The last fight was left as the game's own: the picture was split for two players.","El combate anterior mantuvo las reglas originales: el modo no admite luchadores extra."},
 {"The other player's game is a different version. Search again.","El otro jugador tiene una versión diferente del juego. Vuelve a buscar."},
 {"The second member of each team uses controller 3 or 4 in the team select, instead of the team leader's controller.","Permite que cada jugador elija a su luchador con su propio mando, en lugar de hacerlo el líder del equipo."},
 {"The soft focus on distant scenery.","El desenfoque de los elementos lejanos."},
 {"The tint that shows a fighter behind scenery.","La silueta que permite ver al luchador detrás del escenario."},
 {"The two games connect to each other directly when they can, as in most online fighting","Cuando es posible, los juegos se conectan directamente, como en la mayoría de juegos de lucha"},
 {"The two games could not reach each other, directly or through the relay. Hosting on a port (with port forwarding or a virtual network such as Tailscale) still works.","No se pudo establecer la conexión. Comprueba la dirección o el código y vuelve a intentarlo."},
 {"The two games could not reach each other, directly or through the relay. Search again for another player.","No se pudo conectar, ni directamente ni mediante el servidor de enlace. Busca otro jugador."},
 {"This character cannot be used: %s. Fights stay as the game's own until another is chosen.","No se puede usar este personaje: %s. Se mantiene el combate original hasta elegir otro."},
 {"Time limit","Límite de tiempo"},
 {"Unlock everything: all characters, stages, music and items, and the largest amount of Zenni. This is a debug function the game's developers left in.","Desbloquea personajes, escenarios, música y objetos, y eleva los Zeni al máximo. Es una función de depuración del juego original."},
 {"Update available. Online servers are unreachable until you update.","Hay una actualización. Necesitas actualizar para acceder a los servidores en línea."},
 {"Use a room code (no port forwarding needed)","Usar código de sala (sin abrir puertos)"},
 {"V-sync","Sincronización vertical"},
 {"Waiting for the other player on port %s...","Esperando al otro jugador en el puerto %s..."},
 {"What fills the sides where the picture is narrower than the window:\na 4:3 picture, or the menus with \"Menus in 4:3\", in a wide window.\nFighter panels: the border, and in a fight each side's fighter with its name and form.\nYour own: a folder \"bars\" next to the game with trim.png (the strip along the\npicture, kept in proportion) and fill.png (stretched over the rest). Read at start.","Contenido de las franjas laterales: negro, marco o paneles de luchadores. Puedes usar trim.png y fill.png en la carpeta «bars» junto al juego. Se cargan al iniciar."},
 {"When the game runs at another speed than 100%% (an online match, the Cheats tab):\noff, the music plays as it is; on, it is sped up or slowed down with the game,\nat its own pitch, as an emulator does. Spoken lines always follow the game.","A una velocidad distinta del 100%%, permite que la música siga el ritmo del juego. Las voces siempre lo siguen."},
 {"When this machine cannot show a picture in time, the game normally runs slower.\nWith this on it stays at full speed and leaves pictures out instead (choppier,\nnot slower). It helps where the graphics chip is the slow part. On by default.","Si el PC no puede dibujar a tiempo, omite imágenes en vez de ralentizar el juego. La imagen será menos fluida. Ayuda si el límite está en la GPU."},
 {"When you are connected the game switches to the match: both players get the same roster,","Al conectarse comienza la partida: ambos jugadores tienen el mismo plantel,"},
 {"Where a fight's health bars and gauges sit in a picture wider than 4:3.\nLong health bars: the bars reach from the edges to the timer.\nIn the middle: the original 4:3 arrangement, next to the timer.","Posición del HUD original en pantallas panorámicas. Barras largas: se extienden hasta el reloj. Centrado: conserva la distribución 4:3."},
 {"Whose side it fights on. Fighters of one team do not hit each other.\nOn its own: against both players.","Equipo del luchador añadido. Los compañeros no se dañan entre sí. Por su cuenta: combate contra ambos bandos."},
 {"You get a short code to tell the other player, and the two games find each other through a\nsmall matchmaking service. Works with most home routers. Without it you host on a port,\nwhich must be reachable from the other player (port forwarding or a virtual network).","Recibirás un código corto para compartir. El servidor de enlace permite conectar las partidas sin abrir puertos."},
 {"You have 0.%d.%d; 0.%d.%d or newer is needed. github.com/z3xox/Tenkaichi3Decomp/releases","Tienes 0.%d.%d; necesitas 0.%d.%d o posterior. github.com/z3xox/Tenkaichi3Decomp/releases"},
